  "id": "transition-map-subtypes",
  "title": "TMF Transition Map, sub-types",
  "description": "JRC Tropical Moist Forests (TMF) v1.2025: the forest transition sub-type of every 30 m cell at the end of 2025 (39 classes), one COG per tile. Produced by the European Commission Joint Research Centre; mirrored by Epoch as north-up ZSTD COGs with pixel values unchanged. 86 tiles of about 10 by 10 degrees in EPSG:4326 at 0.00026949 degrees (about 30 m). See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for tested access recipes.",
  "license": "other",
